alyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target coverage"},{"text":"Organ-at-risk doses"},{"text":"Dose-volume relationships"}]}]},{"heading":"3D-CRT vs IMRT Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Compare the concepts of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Beam arrangement"},{"text":"Dose conformity"},{"text":"Normal-tissue protection"},{"text":"Planning complexity"}]}]},{"heading":"Radiotherapy Quality-Assurance Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel/Power BI dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Number of plans"},{"text":"QA status"},{"text":"Rejected plans"},{"text":"Replanning cases"},{"text":"Treatment delays"},{"text":"QA completion rates"}]}]},{"heading":"Medical Imaging Data Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn how DICOM datasets contain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Image data"},{"text":"Study information"},{"text":"Acquisition parameters"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use anonymized educational datasets only."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"table","header":["Internship Area","Value"],"rows":[[{"text":"Radiation Oncology Departments"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Radiotherapy Centres"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Cancer Hospitals"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Medical Physics Departments"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Radiotherapy Technology Units"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Treatment Planning Departments"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Medical Imaging Departments"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Radiation Research Laboratories"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Medical Device Companies"},{"text":"Medium–High"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"During internship, aim to observe:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CT simulation"},{"text":"Immobilization"},{"text":"Treatment planning"},{"text":"Treatment delivery"},{"text":"Patient positioning"},{"text":"Radiation safety"},{"text":"QA procedures"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary meetings"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on qualification and institutional eligibility:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radiotherapy Technologist Trainee"},{"text":"Radiation Therapy Technician"},{"text":"Radiotherapy Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Treatment Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Radiation Oncology Assistant"},{"text":"Treatment Planning Support Associate"},{"text":"Radiotherapy Quality Assistant"},{"text":"Medical Physics Assistant"},{"text":"Radiotherapy Data/Documentation Associate"},{"text":"Radiation Oncology Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For roles involving independent treatment planning or dosimetry, additional specialized qualifications may be required."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Cancer Hospitals"},{"text":"Radiotherapy workflow + patient safety"}],[{"text":"Radiation Oncology Centres"},{"text":"Planning + simulation"}],[{"text":"Medical Physics Departments"},{"text":"Physics + QA"}],[{"text":"Radiotherapy Clinics"},{"text":"Patient workflow + treatment support"}],[{"text":"Medical Device Companies"},{"text":"Radiotherapy equipment"}],[{"text":"Radiation Research Institutes"},{"text":"Physics + research"}],[{"text":"Clinical Research Organizations"},{"text":"Documentation + clinical research"}],[{"text":"Health-Tech Companies"},{"text":"Medical imaging + data"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Certifications & Professional Learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radiation Safety"},{"text":"Radiotherapy Technology"},{"text":"Treatment Planning"},{"text":"Medical Dosimetry fundamentals"},{"text":"Radiation Physics"},{"text":"Radiation Biology"},{"text":"Medical Imaging"},{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"Medical Image Processing"},{"text":"Quality Assurance"},{"text":"Oncology"},{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Python for Medical Imaging"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For clinical roles, formal recognized radiotherapy/medical-radiation technology qualifications and applicable institutional/regulatory requirements are more important than short-term certificates."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Radiotherapy / Medical Radiation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Radiotherapy Technology"},{"text":"MSc Medical Radiation Physics"},{"text":"Advanced programs in Radiation Therapy"},{"text":"Postgraduate programs in Medical Radiation Sciences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Medical Physics"},{"text":"Advanced Medical Physics programs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility for professional medical-physics pathways can be specific to the applicant's undergraduate degree and required physics coursework."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Medical Imaging"},{"text":"MSc Medical Imaging Technology"},{"text":"Medical Image Analysis programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare / Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Clinical Research"},{"text":"MSc Oncology-related programs"},{"text":"MPH"},{"text":"MSc Health Informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Treatment Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Planning systems"},{"text":"Dose distributions"},{"text":"Plan optimization"},{"text":"Plan evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Radiation Therapy Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient positioning"},{"text":"Treatment delivery"},{"text":"Image guidance"},{"text":"Treatment verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Medical Dosimetry"},{"type":"h","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dose calculation"},{"text":"Treatment planning"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Plan evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a specialized role with specific educational and professional requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Radiation Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radiation protection"},{"text":"Safety procedures"},{"text":"Exposure monitoring"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Radiotherapy Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced treatment techniques"},{"text":"Image-guided radiotherapy"},{"text":"Adaptive radiotherapy"},{"text":"AI in treatment planning"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning Route"},{"type":"h","text":"Planning Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Planning Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiotherapy Technical Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Route"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiotherapy Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiotherapy Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Scientist"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Based Treatment Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated contouring"},{"text":"Treatment-plan optimization"},{"text":"Dose prediction"},{"text":"Image segmentation"},{"text":"Quality checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human clinical oversight remains essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Adaptive Radiotherapy"},{"type":"p","text":"Adaptive workflows can adjust treatment based on changes in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tumour size"},{"text":"Patient anatomy"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Organ position"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Image-Guided Radiotherapy"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern systems increasingly combine imaging with treatment delivery to improve positioning and targeting."},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Automation can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data transfer"},{"text":"Plan checks"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Workflow management"},{"text":"Quality-control processes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Radiation Techniques"},{"type":"h","text":"Future-facing areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Proton therapy"},{"text":"Stereotactic radiotherapy"},{"text":"Adaptive radiotherapy"},{"text":"MR-guided radiotherapy"},{"text":"AI-assisted planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future-Ready Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Oncology"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Physics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Biology"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"CT Simulation"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosimetry Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"DICOM"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality Assurance"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI / Medical Image Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly strong 2026+ positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Radiotherapy Technology","Treatment Planning","Medical Imaging","QA","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested Development Plan"},{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Anatomy + oncology + radiation fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Radiotherapy equipment + simulation"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Treatment planning + dosimetry"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Planning support + QA + advanced technology"}],[{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Gain supervised radiation-oncology exposure"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Build treatment-planning workflow expertise"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Specialize in planning, therapy or QA"}],[{"text":"5+ Years"},{"text":"Move toward senior technical or research roles"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Graduation Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain basic cancer biology"},{"text":"Understand radiation therapy principles"},{"text":"Understand radiation physics fundamentals"},{"text":"Explain radiation safety requirements"},{"text":"Understand CT simulation"},{"text":"Understand patient immobilization"},{"text":"Recognize treatment-planning workflows"},{"text":"Understand target-volume and organ-at-risk concepts"},{"text":"Interpret basic dose-volume information"},{"text":"Understand 3D-CRT, IMRT, VMAT and IGRT concepts"},{"text":"Understand treatment-planning-system workflows"},{"text":"Understand DICOM and medical imaging data"},{"text":"Support accurate treatment documentation"},{"text":"Understand radiotherapy QA principles"},{"text":"Work effectively with radiation oncologists, medical physicists and therapy professionals"},{"text":"Follow strict patient-safety and radiation-safety procedures"},{"text":"Use Excel for basic operational/data analysis"},{"text":"Understand emerging AI and adaptive-radiotherapy technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Radiotherapy Technology","Treatment Planning","Radiation Safety","Medical Imaging","Quality Assurance","AI"],"sep":"+","label":"Best positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination provides a strong foundation for Treatment Planning Assistant and radiotherapy-support roles, while creating longer-term pathways into treatment planning, medical dosimetry, radiation therapy technology, radiotherapy QA, medical imaging, research and AI-assisted radiation oncology."}]}]}